Bar, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"3NNRlx0GS0mzrTYCx8m8FQ","review_id":"twU49TNugBSYuyOjHWQUzw","date":"2020-09-30T15:56:28","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9402711391448975,"text_excerpt":"Gianna is a beautiful Italian restaurant. The service was great. And the food well let's go down the list of plates that I had that I loved and put the ones that were missing something. First we had the Italian sausage that was nothing less than spectacular, the flavor was spicy and tingling with enough saltiness from the cheese and oils that just burst in your mouth with a lot of flavor. I recommend those (get 2 orders) Second we went with the meatballs with they were good but after having the Italian sausage, it makes you think that the meatballs could of been better. But they were creamy, saucy and with nothing really overpowering the flavor of the meat other than the red sauce. Then t..."},{"business_id":"3NNRlx0GS0mzrTYCx8m8FQ","review_id":"P1qVAkpuh42xHGPgQp38uQ","date":"2020-11-29T19:10:38","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9402033686637878,"text_excerpt":"Such a great spot for dinner. We had a reservation and they could accommodate us inside or out. Given COVID we opted for outside and they even gave us a nice outdoor heater at our table, nice touch! The servers were really friendly and gave us plenty of recos for their menu + places while we were in town. The food was excellent. Loved the sausage provola. Spicy and cheesy, mangia. Then the lemon ricotta ravioli was a nice light pasta dish. The roasted gulf shrimp was probably some of the best shrimp I've ever had. Sometimes you get shrimp and honestly, the rest of the dishes, sauce and other components completely dominate the shrimp. Not here! You actually get to taste what shrimp is supp..."},{"business_id":"3NNRlx0GS0mzrTYCx8m8FQ","review_id":"GiLkUN0HAa4iuT594XEsNA","date":"2019-09-06T02:50:20","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9398685693740845,"text_excerpt":"This restaurant was fantastic. Made reservations a couple days prior to the visit. Got seated immediately. The two servers we got were fantastic and so nice. It was a party of 5, so we did a lot of sharing. The meatballs ARE A MUST to try!!! Do it! And get the rigatoni with pistachio pesto! I will probably crave that forever. Would go back just for that. The ricotta lemon ravioli was really good. And the swordfish was good too! Good job!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"3NNRlx0GS0mzrTYCx8m8FQ","photo_id":"57rOq6B97oszR-5NHU2LUw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/57rOq6B97oszR-5NHU2LUw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8712887763977051},{"business_id":"3NNRlx0GS0mzrTYCx8m8FQ","photo_id":"Cr_xUsAhzTwKstb1vISAqQ","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/Cr_xUsAhzTwKstb1vISAqQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.86442